## .dockerignore for .NET projects
## Excludes unnecessary files from Docker build context

# Build results
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

# Test results
**/TestResults/
**/*.trx
**/*.coverage
**/*.coveragexml
**/coverage/

# IDE and editor folders
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store

# Git
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Documentation
**/README.md
**/LICENSE
**/*.md

# Docker
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/.dockerignore

# CI/CD
**/.github/

# Environment files
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json

# NuGet
**/*.nupkg
**/*.snupkg
**/packages/

# Kubernetes
**/k8s/

# Misc
**/node_modules/
**/npm-debug.log
**/*.log
